#14100
The Great Tower of Xerxes - Level 2~
This area (14101-14218) forms the 2nd level of the Great Tower of Xerxes.

The connection points are as follows:

South of 14101 connected to 14084.
South of 14218 connected to 14301.

The primary purpose of this level is to provide a reasnoble location for
groups of characters to obtain xps. The majority of the inhabitants are
golems who have lots of hps, hit plenty hard, but hit rarely against someone
with an ac of -100. They will hit more often against victims not as well
protected, how ever. There are also some smaller monsters which hit fairly
hard, but miss rarely and have relatively few hps. There purpose is to catch
groups fighting the golems and screw them over forcing them to rest more often
than they would like. Even taking the smaller monsters out of the equation,
groups will still have to rest since when a Iron Golem does hit you, you
stay hit :) There are a few items of interest here to mid-level characters,
less powerfull and less difficult to obtain then the equivalent high level
items. Characters really ought to come here grouped, while not nearly as
nasty as the higher levels, it would be difficult alone. Groups venturing
here should be about 30th+ level, otherwise people will probably get killed.

This area was written by Vex.
~
