#14129
A small room~
You've entered a small chamber, seperated from the main part of the hall.
It's clear there was once something kept here, for there are smashed wooden
fragments scattered about the place. Who ever destroyed this place did a
rather good job of it. Perhaps it was once used as a cloak room of some
kind, for there are still some pegs in the wall. The only exit lies back to
the north.
~
