#14164
The Altar~
You have come to a stone dais, rising up three broad steps from the north,
south and west. A simple, yet beautifull altar of white marble is here, once
the centre of worship in this place. A faded painting on the eastern wall
depicts a radiant female being, arms upraised and light shining from her in
all directions like she was the sun. A frown you were hardly aware of lifts
from your forehead, you feel a sense of peace and well-being.
~
