painting~
Looking closely at the painting, you can see the radiant figure holds a shaft
of what appears to be pure light in her right hand. Shining like a star, a
golden lantern rests gently at her feet, while her form is draped in robes
of utmost beauty. The goddess herself is depicted as a woman more comely
then any you have ever seen, the artist has captured well the perfection of
a godlike form.
~
